                <li>Applies across MT101 SCORE, pain.001 SCORE+, and proprietary bank channels alike.</li>
                <li>Returned payments mean late settlements, supplier friction, and manual rework.</li>
                <li>The requirement covers all payment types — trade, FX, funds, and securities included.</li>
